1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,327
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,327 --> 00:00:03,748
Let's learn kind words to say.

3
00:00:04,298 --> 00:00:05,991
Hello, everyone!

4
00:00:07,341 --> 00:00:10,127
We say hello when we see a friend.

5
00:00:10,627 --> 00:00:12,555
Can you say hello?

6
00:00:14,155 --> 00:00:15,849
Hello, Teddy!

7
00:00:16,399 --> 00:00:17,992
Hello, Mimzi!

8
00:00:19,342 --> 00:00:22,080
We say good morning when we wake up.

9
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:24,699
Can you say good morning?

10
00:00:26,299 --> 00:00:28,758
Good morning, sunshine!

11
00:00:30,108 --> 00:00:32,918
We say please when we want something.

12
00:00:33,418 --> 00:00:35,346
Can you say please?

13
00:00:36,946 --> 00:00:39,467
Can I have a cookie, please?

14
00:00:40,817 --> 00:00:43,745
We say thank you when someone helps us.

15
00:00:44,245 --> 00:00:46,388
Can you say thank you?

16
00:00:47,988 --> 00:00:49,681
Thank you, Mimzi!

17
00:00:50,231 --> 00:00:52,348
You're welcome, Teddy!

18
00:00:53,698 --> 00:00:56,484
We say sorry when we make a mistake.

19
00:00:56,984 --> 00:00:58,984
Can you say sorry?

20
00:01:00,584 --> 00:01:02,963
Oops! I'm sorry, Teddy.

21
00:01:03,513 --> 00:01:04,824
That's okay!

22
00:01:06,174 --> 00:01:09,245
We say goodbye when a friend goes home.

23
00:01:09,745 --> 00:01:11,840
Can you say goodbye?

24
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:14,902
Goodbye, Teddy!

25
00:01:14,902 --> 00:01:16,202
See you soon!

26
00:01:17,552 --> 00:01:20,052
We say good night at bedtime.

27
00:01:20,552 --> 00:01:22,600
Can you say good night?

28
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:25,825
Good night, Teddy.

29
00:01:25,825 --> 00:01:27,063
Sweet dreams.

30
00:01:28,413 --> 00:01:30,603
Let's say them all together!

31
00:01:31,153 --> 00:01:33,050
Hello! Good morning!

32
00:01:33,050 --> 00:01:33,875
Please!

33
00:01:34,125 --> 00:01:35,165
Thank you!

34
00:01:35,165 --> 00:01:36,605
Sorry! Goodbye!

35
00:01:36,855 --> 00:01:38,185
Good night!

36
00:01:39,585 --> 00:01:41,823
Great job, little learner!

37
00:01:42,373 --> 00:01:44,262
Share Mimzi with a friend,

38
00:01:44,262 --> 00:01:46,802
and subscribe for more learning fun!

39
00:01:47,352 --> 00:01:48,220
Next time,

40
00:01:48,220 --> 00:01:50,759
let's play find the missing letter.

41
00:01:51,009 --> 00:01:52,380
Bye bye!
